          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልቅሶ ፡ (ኀዘን ፡ ቢል ፡ አንድ ፡ ነው) ፡ አያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገኘኝም ፡ ብላ ፡ ነበረና ፡ ኤር ፡ ፶ ፥ ፳፱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢሳ ፡ ፵፯ ፡ ፯ ፥ ፰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": "፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፰ ፤ ወበእንተ ፡ ዝንቱ ፡ በአሐቲ ፡ ሰዓት ፡ ይመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽእ ፡ ላዕሌሃ ፡ መቅሠፍታ ፡ ሞት ፡ ወላሀኒ ፡ ወረ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኃብኒ ፡⟫",
